{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 24, :comments ["<b>Nothing for me.</b> You said, <b>Give me the persons</b>; apart from me you may take it, for I lay no claim to it whatsoever." "<b>Only what the young men ate, and the portion of the men.</b> This alone I will take of all that is yours — the expenditure made for the young men's eating — and I will also take the portion of the men who went with me." "But <b>Aner, Eshcol, and Mamre — they shall take their portion.</b> I will neither give them a portion nor take a portion on their behalf; rather, they shall take from themselves, as leaders."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:30:09.333512340Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}